# Hand-labelled retrieval eval set — source material, not a build artifact.
# It must be versioned: comparing a retrieval change against a baseline is
# only meaningful if both runs scored against the same, reviewable dataset.
!data/eval/
!data/eval/**
*.faiss
*.index

